'''Piety Beam''' is a [[debuff]] from [[Piety]] when she use a skill to disable [[Malachai, The Nightmare]]'s invulnerable shield during [[Act 4]]. Although this skill is aimed at Malachai, players and allies crossing through the beam will take Lightning Damage over Time and will be [[Shocked]].

The icon is the same as [[Degeneration Aura]] (lightning damage variant), [[Scientist's Beam]] and [[Lightning Beam]].

